### User Register
POST http://localhost:4000/user-api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "sammy",
  "lastName": "luna",
  "email": "sam@mail.com",
  "password": "sam@12345",
  "ProfileImageUrl": "https://example.com/avatars/user.png"
}

### User Login
POST http://localhost:4000/common-api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sam@mail.com",
  "password": "sam@12345"
  
}

### User read all articles
GET http://localhost:4000/user-api/articles


###add comments
POST http://localhost:4000/user-api/articles/:articleId/comments



